ToS-DETR

This project adapts Deformable DETR for 2.5D costal cartilage fracture detection.
The ToS-DETR modifications, medical input pipeline, training schedule,
external inference utilities, and project documentation are provided by the
ToS-DETR contributors unless otherwise noted.

